l highlight cluster.\",\"Regularize the right and lower outlines to a consistent one-pixel contour, removing the bulky black staircase near the tail junction.\",\"Remove or reshape the top antenna into a small mantle point or side fin so the silhouette reads immediately as a squid.\"]}",
